How We Use Your Data
To assess your creditworthiness and ability to repay before advancing a loan;
To process your application, disburse funds, and administer your loan account;
To verify your identity, including through the Integrated Population Registration System (IPRS), where necessary;
To report positive and negative credit information to licensed Credit Reference Bureaus;
To comply with our obligations under the CBK Digital Credit Providers Regulations, 2022, the Proceeds of Crime and Anti-Money Laundering Act, and other applicable law;
To handle complaints and provide customer support;
To send you service messages relating to your loan account; and
With your consent, to send you marketing communications about our products, which you may opt out of at any time.

5. Sharing Your Data
