Licensed Credit Reference Bureaus, for credit reporting and appraisal purposes;
The Central Bank of Kenya and other regulators, where required by law;
Payment partners (e.g., M-Pesa, our banking partners) to process disbursements and repayments;
Your employer, strictly for payroll deduction purposes, where you have a Check-Off Loan;
Licensed debt collection agents, where a loan is non-performing, who are contractually bound to the fair debt-collection standards in our Terms and Conditions;
Professional advisers (auditors, lawyers) and technology service providers who process data on our instructions, under written confidentiality and data-processing agreements; and
Any authority where disclosure is required by law or a valid court order.

Your Rights as a Data Subject
