be informed of the use to which your personal data is to be put;
access your personal data held by us;
request correction of inaccurate or outdated personal data;
request the deletion of your personal data, subject to any legal or regulatory retention requirement;
object to, or restrict, the processing of your data in certain circumstances;
withdraw consent to processing based on consent, at any time; and
lodge a complaint with the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner (ODPC), Kenya.

